    "body": "@sylph01 I believe your diagnosis is correct. So a pull request would just change both instances of \"the [current high resolution time](https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-high-resolution-time)\" to \"the [current high resolution time](https://w3c.github.io/hr-time/#dfn-current-high-resolution-time) given _W_\". We would love such a pull request!",
